n: 3.13.1.8
name: why-rewrite-did-not-carry
kind: finding
is: The C rewrite replaced the C and kept the contract: the 124-name primitive registry, two surface grammars and the band pins. Its hours went into covering the old surface again in new C, and its one new part, a frame interpreter over values passed as wide structs, was slower than the old seed's walker, in which integers ride as tagged words.
