n: 3.13.1.9
name: causes-of-not-carrying
kind: finding
is: Six causes are named across the two restarts, five in the C rewrite and one in the carrier; none is shown in both. The rewrite: parity with the old surface was the acceptance test; a second reader appeared in C within a day; the first recorded comparison of speed with main is in its last commit; 200 files landed in one commit; and the second witness was built after the candidate. The carrier: it and the body were never joined by an image.
status: inferred
