n: 3.13.2.2
name: produce-proof-bypasses-membrane
kind: observation
is: The carrier commit is titled 'The greenfield carrier produces fkwu and form-cli', yet the production does not pass through the membrane: gf_produce in the witness file uses a private fork and exec helper to run cc -O2 on runtime/fkwu-uni.c. The membrane's own process port is exercised only with /usr/bin/true.
