n: 3.13.2.12
name: why-carrier-did-not-carry
kind: finding
is: The greenfield carrier is a small implementation of the axioms' floor with no bridge from the body's source to an image it could thaw, and its commit title claims a production that its code hands to the old seed. The next commit on the theme, 19 hours later, was a new source interpreter in C, and the carrier was not touched again.
