is: What the two specs beside the axioms and the three ground files ask of a bootstrap, and what a new C bootstrap could take from the carrier: about 460 lines nearly unchanged and 530 to rewrite behind the same contract. The study estimates 1,350 to 1,500 lines of C without a walker and 1,800 to 2,200 with one, under conditions the earlier attempts did not set. Nothing in the specs or the carrier says how the first image comes to exist.
