n: 3.13.3.4
name: standalone-estimate
kind: finding
is: To stand alone the carrier lacks an entry, a store that scales, an image format for shared graphs, a walker or a binary seed, most doors and a code arena. The study estimates a standalone C bootstrap at 1,350 to 1,500 lines with a binary seed per target, or 1,800 to 2,200 with a walker and a numeric seed, above the first round's 1,400 to 1,600.
status: inferred
