n: 3.13.8
name: keep
kind: hub
is: Seven things to carry forward. From the carrier: the word that keeps nothing apart from state 0; equality by canonical bytes, with children named by identity; one offer entry with publication apart from entry and a callback passed to leaf code; ports with three distinct answers; minting, whole-image refusal and unresumed faults. From the rewrite and the notes: a second witness built first, and a build key of seed digest plus target.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r2/gap-earlier-rewrites

n: 3.13.8.1
name: keep-word-nothing-apart-from-zero
kind: finding
is: Keep the carrier's word: 0 is state 0, 1 is state 1, 2 is nothing and a node is a tagged slot, so that nothing and state 0 are different words and any other bit pattern is not a word. The study calls this the only encoding in either tree that maps one to one onto axiom 1.
status: inferred
from: 3.13.2.3 1.1
conf: high
limit: Whether the integer 1 and state 1 are the same thing to leaf code is open; the carrier merges them at the ABI-1 boundary.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r2/gap-earlier-rewrites

n: 3.13.8.2
name: keep-equality-is-bytes-children-by-identity
kind: finding
is: Keep the rule that equality is the canonical bytes and a digest only indexes, and change the canonical form so that a cell names its children by identity instead of holding their bytes. In the carrier a shared child doubles the bytes at every level, and 16 levels reach 2,621,420 bytes.
status: inferred
from: 3.13.2.4 3.13.2.11 1.3
conf: high
limit: Whether a collision-resistant digest must exist in C or FNV may stay as an index is not settled.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r2/gap-earlier-rewrites

n: 3.13.8.3
name: keep-offer-publication-and-callback
kind: finding
is: Keep offer as the single entry with a two-field outcome (arrived, ack), keep publication of machine code apart from entering it, and keep a leaf ABI in which code receives its offer callback as an argument and therefore holds no absolute address.
status: inferred
from: 3.13.2.5 3.13.2.7 1.5
conf: high
limit: Whether held work (arrived = 0) should be visible to leaf code is open; the carrier turns it into nothing at the callback.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r2/gap-earlier-rewrites

