n: 3.13.9
name: drop
kind: hub
is: Seven things to let go: the old bands and registry as the acceptance test of a new floor; a second reader of the surface in C; wide struct values and a journal replayed by every process; doors chosen by a number that can differ between runtimes; fixed tables, path buffers and observations kept in the store they observe; titles and green checks that claim more than the code does; and landing a whole stack as one commit.
